WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.000
Just ask your agent.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.258
Ask in plain English. Claude picks up the windowctl skill.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.683
TextEdit and Calculator, tiled on the right.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.004
Point at the seven, with a green arrow.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.836
Find the Format menu, and circle it.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.126
Found through accessibility, not guessed pixels.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.786
And clean up when you're done.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.633
windowctl. Install it, then just ask.
